%% alt: Sequence diagram of recalculation. You type 3 instead of 1 in a qty cell. Excel marks the cells that depend on it as dirty, so line_total recalculates, then the SUMIFS total that depends on line_total recalculates. The PivotTable does not change by itself; you must press Refresh, after which it reads the new line_total values.
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant U as You
  participant Q as Cell qty
  participant L as Cell line_total
  participant S as SUMIFS total
  participant P as PivotTable
  U->>Q: type 3 instead of 1
  Q-->>L: marks it dirty
  L->>L: recalculates qty * unit_price
  L-->>S: marks it dirty
  S->>S: recalculates the total
  Note over P: not recalculated automatically
  U->>P: Refresh (Alt+F5)
  P->>L: reads the new line_total
  P-->>U: pivot matches the table again
